  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$E_{n}=-3.4 \\mathrm{eV}$\nThe kinetic energyis equal to the magnitude of total energy in this case. $\\therefore \\mathrm{K.E}=+3.4 \\mathrm{eV}$\nThe de Broglie wavelength of electron\n$\\begin{aligned} \\lambda=\\frac{h}{\\sqrt{2 m K}} &=\\frac{6.64 \\times 10^{-34}}{\\sqrt{2 \\times 9.1 \\times 10^{-31} \\times 3.4 \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19}}} \\mathrm{eV} \\\\ &=0.66 \\times 10^{-9} \\mathrm{~m} \\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
